============================== Reviewer Analysis ==============================
Root cause is a boundary patch name mismatch between your mesh and your initial fields.

- `blockMeshDict` defines patches as `fuelInlet`, `bottomWall`, `leftWall`, `rightWall`, `top`, `frontAndBack`.
- But `0/p` (and likely `0/U`) use different names like `inlet`, `bottomLeft`, `bottomRight`, `sideWalls`.
